<title>USA: Cinemasters Group buys Avenue Pictures.</title>
<headline>Cinemasters Group buys Avenue Pictures.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CineMasters Group Inc said on Monday it has acquired Avenue Pictures, a Hollywood-based independent production company.</p>
<p>It bought Avenue for 1,425,000 shares of CineMasters stock, worth about $4.27 million.</p>
<p>The new company will be renamed Avenue Entertainment Group Inc, subject to stockholder approval, and will apply for listing with NASDAQ.</p>
<p>Avenue has produced such motion pictures as Drugstore Cowboy, The Player and Short Cuts.</p>
</text>
